                            {
                                "example_id": "c13e3825-3613-4c11-81b5-9b4c5018aff7",
                                "sense_id": "9a5e26fd-3fb3-3dfd-854b-fe0b1ccf710c",
                                "text": "Губе́рнский архите́ктор воздви́гнул о́ба зда́ния с одобре́ния поко́йного Одинцо́ва, не терпе́вшего никаки́х пусты́х и самопроизво́льных, как он выража́лся, нововведе́ний.",
                                "translation": "The provincial architect had designed both buildings according to the instructions of the late Odintsov, who could not endure--as he expressed it--senseless and arbitrary innovations.",
                                "english": "The provincial architect had designed both buildings according to the instructions of the late Odintsov, who could not endure--as he expressed it--senseless and arbitrary innovations."
                            }
                        ]
